  <entry>
    <title>RAG 全景解析：检索增强生成从原理到落地</title>
    <link href="https://carlyuhq.github.io/Blogs/2026/07/02/RAG%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/"/>
